1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Date of birth identified in Siegfried Wolf. ''Juden in Thüringen 1933-1945: Biographische Daten''. (2000), vol 2, (unpaginated)
2 CONT * Identified as son of Süssmann and Sophia (née Speyer) Linz in Wolf.
2 CONT * Identified as husband of Babette Linz, see Wolf
2 CONT * Identified as father of Sidonie Riesenfeld, Julius Linz, Sophie Linz, Rosamunde Rainowitz, see Wolf
2 CONT * Date/place of death, and date/place of burial, see Wolf There is confusion in the records between two men called "Berthold Linz" both born in Rotenburg an der Fulda.  This profile is for Berthold Linz, b. 1875 in Rotenburg, who 
2 CONC moved to Eisenach in Thüringen, and died in 1936.  The other Berthold Linz "was born in Rotenburg an der Fulda, Germany in 1867 to Feist and Bertha nee Katz. He was a retiree and married to Rebecka nee Gruenewald. Prior to WWII he
2 CONC  lived in Keerbergen, Belgium. He was murdered in the Shoah." Page of Testimony submitted by his granddaughter; see https://yvng.yadvashem.org/nameDetails.html?language=en&itemId=5243180&ind=2 See as well entry in the German Natio
2 CONC nal Archives, ''Memorial Book.''
