2 NOTE Oops... sorry ... One more update (got mixed up): according to my information Regina's husband is Lehmann Fleischhacker, born 19 mrt 1872 in Wonfurt, Bayern, Germany .
2 NOTE Hi Aviad,
3 CONT
3 CONT One more detail :-).
3 CONT
3 CONT I think my Pfeuffer tree was the basis for the tree posted on Geni.com. As I wasn't sure previously where to put her, Regina Fleischhacker-Pfeuffer (also featured on your picture) was still missing from my tree, and therefore also
3 CONC  missing on Geni.com. I know now she was the second child/ oldest daughter of Jacob David. Regina Fleischhacker-Pfeuffer was born 7 feb 1878 in Giebelstadt, she passed away in New York, I don't know her husbands first name.  
3 CONT
3 CONT If you follow https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-163312202-1-501858/david-pfeuffer-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-d67cac2eef240fb1d6cd736350e070ac&mrid=bc83c4cd6d182a8bc9c9745027bcf686 you can see th
3 CONC e rest of her descendants.
3 CONT
3 CONT Best regards,
3 CONT
3 CONT Erik Lyppens
