2 NOTE Hi Naama. We just went through a couple boxes of Meta's things and found some pictures.  The picture of Elka and David is quite old... I'm not sure if I can get a better scan, but I'll send what I can.  I'm going to upload another
3 CONC  picture of David and Elka.. perhaps you'll be able to identify the two women behind them.  There aren't too many pictures of Leo's family -- but I do have a box in California in storage of some old photos.  
3 CONT
3 CONT Best,
3 CONT David
