2 CONT Yad Vashem database says from based on a List of persecuted persons found in List of Jews who perished in Sachsenhausen camp, 1938-1942 date of birth is Feb 22, 1894. http://www.yadvashem.org/wps/portal/!ut/p/_s.7_0_A/7_0_FL/.cmd/
