2 CONT * Date/place of birth identified in Siegfried Wolf. ''Juden in Thüringen 1933-1945: Biographische Daten''. (2000), vol. 2 (unpaginated)
2 CONT * Identified as son of Ruben and Bertha (née Katz) Spangenthal, see Wolf.
2 CONT * Identified as husband of Elfriede (née Brylewski) Spangenthal, see Wolf.
2 CONT * Identified as father of Hans-Günther Spangenthal, Ernst-Jochen Spangenthal, and Eva Maria Spangenthal, see Wolf.
2 CONT * Date/place of death in German National Archives, Memorial Book (below).  
2 CONT * Stolpersteine were laid for Elfriede, Ludwig, Hans-Günther and Ernst-Jochen Spangenthai in 2012 in Eisenach; see https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liste_der_Stolpersteine_in_Eisenach
2 CONT
