1 NOTE My grandfather took me everyday first to the post office and then to the railway station to look for 
2 CONT parcels for his shop.
2 CONT There was a chocolate automat at the station and he gave me a 10 f to buy a chocolate bar. When we 
2 CONT came home I did not want to eat my dinner.  My grandmother found out and said if Opa give you money 
2 CONT for chocolate you must bring it home and you can eat it after dinner. Next day when I had bought the 
2 CONT chocolate I put it in my pocket and Opa said why do you not eat your chocolate ?/ So I said " Oma told 
2 CONT me to eat it after dinner" Opa took me back to the station, gave me an other 10f and said " one to eat 
2 CONT and one to show Oma" 
2 CONT Jim Newall 2005
