1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:JB8J-9ZG
2 CONT
2 CONT GOLDSMITH, LUDWIG MICHAEL Published: July 24, 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT GOLDSMITH--Ludwig Michael , known as Michael, 57, of Upper Montclair, NJ, died at Columbia Presbyterian Medical Center on July 23, 2008. Michael is the beloved husband of Linda Engelhardt and the proud father of Marla of New York 
2 CONC City, Gary of New York City and Wendy of Upper Montclair, NJ. He is also survived by his mother, Marianne Goldsmith, of Bedminster, NJ, his siblings Laurie Goldsmith-Heitner and her husband Saul of Westfield, NJ, Jody Goldsmith an
2 CONC d his wife Amira of Crofton, MD, Melanie Shapiro and her husband Joel of Bound Brook, NJ and many loving nieces and nephews. Michael was the owner of Ludwig Michael Goldsmith, AIA, an architectural firm in Manhattan. He specialize
2 CONC d in interiors as well as building design for both profit and non-profit organizations. He is a graduate of the Cornell University School of Architecture and has a Masters in Urban Planning from the City College of New York. Micha
2 CONC el served as an officer in the United States Navy for four years following his college graduation. Michael gave countless hours to various projects for his synagogue and anyone and everyone who needed his advice and assistance. Hi
2 CONC s love for life was contagious as well as his laughter and beautiful spirit. Michael's funeral will be held on Thursday, July 24 at noon at Congregation Shomrei Emunah in Montclair, New Jersey. Interment will follow at Cedar Park 
2 CONC Cemetery. In lieu of flowers, please send donations to a charity of your choice.
