1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Clementine TEDESCO
2 CONT France, Vital Records Index
2 CONT Record type:	Birth
2 CONT Birth:	Mar 13 1844 - Paris 5e, Paris, Île-de-France, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Clementine TEDESCO
2 CONT France, Church Baptisms and Civil Births
2 CONT Birth:	Mar 13 1844 - Paris 5e (Ancien), Paris, Île-de-France, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral notice gives date of burial Sunday 26 September, and she died 73 years old. Given her birth in March 1844, the age at death stated in the funeral notice suggests she died September 1917.  However, 26 September 1917 was a W
2 CONC ednesday, and was Yom Kippur, so this was not the funeral date.  More likely Sunday 26 September 1915, and she died aged 71, not 73.
