2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=7159373
2 CONT
2 CONT Leopold "Leo" Rosenthal
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Aug. 21, 1889, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	1960, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Leopold was born in Lage, Germany. He was the son of David and Elka Werthan Rosenthal. His siblings were: Hulda Rosenthal; Zigfried Rosenthal; Dina Zilversmit; Karl Rosenthal; Rosalie Rosenthal; Yosef (Hugo) Yashuvi (Rosenthal); L
2 CONC eopold Rosenthal; Georg Rosenthal (Leo's twin); Grete Rosenthal and Alma Rosenthal. Leo served in the German Military during World War I. In August 1920, he married Meta Stern. They had 3 children together. Wayne was born August 2
2 CONC 0, 1921. A daughter was their second child, but she died at a young age. Then was Edgar Rosenthal, born September 22, 1927. In 1939, Leo spent 6 weeks in a concentration camp in Germany, but was released based on his ranking in th
2 CONC e Germany military during the First World War. Several days later, Meta, the 2 children, and Leo left Germany for the United States. They entered in NY, and settled in Providence, RI, USA. The family moved to Los Angeles, CA, USA 
2 CONC in 1950. Leo did shoe repair for a living. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT   Meta Stern Rosenthal (1891 - 1980)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT   Wayne Rosenthal (1921 - 1976)*
2 CONT
2 CONT   Edgar Rosenthal (1927 - 1994)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
