2 CONT * Records available in the Ancestry.com database indicate that Rosamund and Moritz Rabinowitz left Bolivia for the United States in 1953; see Ancestry.com. ''U.S., WWII Alien Registration, 1940-1955'' [database on-line]. Lehi, UT,
