2 CONT * Morris Rainowitz became an American citizen in November 1960; see United States Alien Case Files (Ancestry.com)
2 CONT * Morris Rainowitz died on 12 February 1986; Date/place of death, and place of burial, see Worldwide Jewish Burial Registry (Ancestry.com)
