2 CONT WE, BARBARA WINTON of 48, Ivor Court, London, N.W.i, Widow, a British subject by marriage, CHARLOTTE MATILDA WINTON of 10, Belsize Crescent, "London, N.W.3, Spinster, a natural born British subject, NICHOLAS GEORGE WINTON of 20, W
2 CONC illow Road, 'London, N.W.3, Stockbroker, a natural 'born British subject, and ROBERT CHARLES WINTON of 20, Willow Road aforesaid, B.Sc. Wireless Engineer, a natural born British subject heretofore respectively called and known by 
2 CONC the names of Babette (or Babi) Wortham or Wertheim, Charlotte Mathilde Wortham or Wertheim, Nicholas George Wortham or Wertheim and Robert Charles. Wortham or Wertheim hereby give notice that we have respectively renounced and aba
2 CONC ndoned our names of Babette '(or Babi) Wortham or Wertheim, Charlotte Mathilde Wortham or Wertheim, Nicholas George Wortham or Wertheim and Robert Charles Wortham or Wertheim and that we have respectively assumed .and intend hence
2 CONC forth on all occasions whatsoever and at all -times to sign and use and to be called and known respectively by the names of Barbara Winton, Charlotte Matilda Winton, Nicholas George Winton and Robert Charles Winton in lieu of and 
2 CONC in substitution for our respective former names of Babette (or Babi) Wortham or Wertheim, Charlotte Mathilde Wortham or Wertheim, Nicholas George Wortham or Wertheim and Robert Charles Wortham or Wertheim. And we also hereby give 
2 CONC notice that such .change of name is formally declared and evidenced -by a deed poll under our. handp .and seals dated the seventeenth day of October one thousand nine hundred and thirty-eight duly executed and attested, and that s
2 CONC uch deed poll was enrolled in the Central Office of the Supreme Court .of Judicature on the twenty-first day of October one thousand nine hundred and thirty-eight.—Dated this thirty-first day of October 1938.
2 CONT
2 CONT BARBARA WINTON, formerly Babette (Babi) Wortham or Wertheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT CHARLOTTE MATILDA WINT.ON, formerly Charlotte Mathilde Wortham or Wertheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT NICHOLAS GEORGE WINTON, formerly Nicholas George Wortham or Wertheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT CHARLES WINTON, formerly Robert Charles Wortham or Wertheim.
