2 CONC or the Pfalz, losing him as their deserved chairman. the Association of the Jewish communities Palatine and the Association of Bavarian Israelite communities laments the loss of one of his best. his high intellectual gifts and an 
2 CONC unusual energy, a warm heart for the needs of the time, made him a true philanthropist. on each occasion he has proved that he is a leader in Judaism was, for the benefit of immediate homeland as for the benefit of our homeland -.
